###  https://nfdi.fiz-karlsruhe.de/ontology/NFDI_0000009
<https://nfdi.fiz-karlsruhe.de/ontology/NFDI_0000009> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                      rdfs:label "obsolete dataset"@en ;
                                                      <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An information content entity that refers to a structured collection of data, organized typically for a specific goal such as analysis, research, or reference. Dataset is structured information about a resource provided by an organization or a person."@en .


###  https://nfdi.fiz-karlsruhe.de/ontology/NFDI_0000222
<https://nfdi.fiz-karlsruhe.de/ontology/NFDI_0000222> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                      rdfs:label "web application software"@en ;
                                                      <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Software that is installed on a server and can be used by users via a web page and the internet, for example Software-as-a-service (SaaS)."@en .


###  https://nfdi.fiz-karlsruhe.de/ontology/NFDI_0001095
<https://nfdi.fiz-karlsruhe.de/ontology/NFDI_0001095> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                      rdfs:subClassOf <https://nfdi.fiz-karlsruhe.de/ontology/NFDI_0000222> ;
                                                      rdfs:label "sparql endpoint"@de ;
                                                      <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A SPARQL Endpoint is a web application software that provides a queryable interface for accessing and retrieving structured data from RDF-based knowledge graphs using the SPARQL query language."@en .


